24
00:01:19,614 --> 00:01:22,482
Oilangizda necha kishi bor?

25
00:01:22,505 --> 00:01:25,508
Oilamiz uch kishidan iborat.

26
00:01:25,532 --> 00:01:28,766
Xotinim va bitta farzandim bor.

27
00:01:28,789 --> 00:01:31,189
Shundaymi?

28
00:01:31,212 --> 00:01:34,378
Yapon tilini oʻrganish qanday?

29
