00:13:36,228 --> 00:13:40,762
Yaponlar juda mehribon.

235
00:13:40,785 --> 00:13:44,918
Ovqat ham juda mazali, shuning uchun mamnunman.

236
00:13:44,941 --> 00:13:46,907
Yaxshi ekan.

237
00:13:46,930 --> 00:13:49,404
Ishingiz nima?

238
00:13:49,428 --> 00:13:54,046
Men avtomobil zavodida muhandisman.

239
00:13:54,070 --> 00:13:57,403
Mashinalarni yigʻish bilan shugʻullanaman.

240
00:13:57,426 --> 00:13:59,428
Ajoyib ekan!

241
00:13:59,452 --> 00:14:02,186
Oilangizda necha kishi bor?

242
00:14:02,209 --> 00:14:05,342
Oilamiz toʻrt kishidan iborat.

243
00:14:05,365 --> 00:14:08,132
Ota-onam va singlim bor.

244
00:14:08,155 --> 00:14:10,555
Ular Vetnamdamisiz?

245
00:14:10,578 --> 00:14:13,716
Ha, ular Vetnamda.

246
00:14:13,739 --> 00:14:19,428
Baʼzida yolgʻizlik his qilaman. Yapon tilini oʻrganish qanday?

247
00:14:19,452 --> 00:14:23,218
Kanji oʻqish qiyin.

248
00:14:23,241 --> 00:14:26,375
Har kuni qancha vaqt oʻrganasiz?

249
00:14:26,398 --> 00:14:31,164
Har kuni ishdan keyin ikki soat oʻrganaman.

250
00:14:31,187 --> 00:14:35,154
Ishdan keyin oʻrganish ajoyib ekan.

251
00:14:35,177 --> 00:14:39,861
Yapon taomlari ichida eng yaxshi koʻrgan narsangiz nima?

252
00:14:39,885 --> 00:14:43,651
Men tonkotsu ramenni eng yaxshi koʻraman.

253
00:14:43,674 --> 00:14:46,508
Shoʻrvasi juda mazali.

254
00:14:46,531 --> 00:14:49,164
Lagʻmon juda mazali, shunday emasmi?

255
00:14:49,187 --> 00:14:54,920
Dam olish kunlari yoki hafta oxirlarida odatda nima qilib yurursiz?

256
00:14:54,943 --> 00:14:58,355
Dostlarim bilan doimo mashina haydab chiqamiz.

257
00:14:58,378 --> 00:15:01,557
Yapon mashinalari ajoyib!

258
00:15:01,581 --> 00:15:04,021
Ha, rostini aytsam, texniklaringizga hatsizmi!

259
00:15:04,044 --> 00:15:07,821
Yaponiyaning qaysi mashhur shaxsini yoqtirasiz?

260
00:15:07,845 --> 00:15:11,141
Shohey Ohtani.

261
00:15:11,164 --> 00:15:15,331
Beysbolda juda zoʻr, shuning uchun hurmat qilaman.

262
00:15:15,354 --> 00:15:18,687
Ohtani haqiqatan ham ajoyib!

263
00:15:18,710 --> 00:15:21,756
Yaponiyaning transport vositalari haqida qanday fikrdasiz?

264
00:15:21,780 --> 00:15:26,113
Poyezdlar va Shinkansen juda aniq ishlaydi, hayratda qoldim!

265
00:15:26,136 --> 00:15:29,770
Hech qachon kechikmaydi.

266
00:15:29,793 --> 00:15:32,170
Yaponiyaning faxri bu!

267
00:15:32,193 --> 00:15:35,393
Vyetnamda nima mashhur?

268
00:15:35,417 --> 00:15:38,983
Ao Dai degan milliy libosimiz mashhur.

269
00:15:39,006 --> 00:15:42,242
Pho degan lagʻmon taomimiz ham juda mazali.

270
00:15:42,266 --> 00:15:45,344
Pho men ham juda yoqtiraman!

271
00:15:45,367 --> 00:15:48,968
Kelajakda Yaponiyada nima qilishni xohlaysiz?

272
00:15:48,991 --> 00:15:52,624
Oʻzimning kompaniyamni ochmoqchiman.

273
00:15:52,647 --> 00:15:56,138
Yapon texnologiyalaridan koʻp foydalanmoqchiman.

274
00:15:56,162 --> 00:15:58,018
Omadingizni bersin!

275
00:15:58,041 --> 00:15:59,975
Katta rahmat.

276
00:15:59,998 --> 00:16:02,131
Katta rahmat.

