283
00:16:19,117 --> 00:16:21,850
Mari siz, shundaymi?

284
00:16:21,873 --> 00:16:24,889
Qayerdan keldingiz?

285
00:16:24,913 --> 00:16:28,892
Fransiyaning Parij shahridanman.

286
00:16:28,915 --> 00:16:32,087
Parijdanmi?!

287
00:16:32,111 --> 00:16:35,678
Yaponiyada qanchadan beri yashaysiz?

288
00:16:35,700 --> 00:16:40,193
Yaponiyada toʻqqiz oy boʻldi.

289
00:16:40,217 --> 00:16:42,284
Toʻqqiz oy, shundaymi?

290
00:16:42,307 --> 00:16:46,326
Yaponiyadagi hayotingiz qanday?

291
00:16:46,349 --> 00:16:51,682
Yaponiyaning ibodatxonalari va ziyoratgohlari juda goʻzal.

292
00:16:51,705 --> 00:16:55,916
Bu yerda juda koʻp tinch joylar bor.

293
00:16:55,940 --> 00:16:57,916
Ha, shunday.

294
00:16:57,939 --> 00:17:01,139
Ishingiz nima?

295
00:17:01,162 --> 00:17:05,496
Men nonvoyxona shogirdiiman.

296
00:17:05,519 --> 00:17:09,128
Yapon nonvoyxonasida ishlayman.

297
00:17:09,151 --> 00:17:11,751
Qiziqarli ekan!

298
00:17:11,774 --> 00:17:15,443
Oilangizda necha kishi bor?

299
00:17:15,466 --> 00:17:18,633
Oilamiz uch kishidan iborat.

300
00:17:18,656 --> 00:17:22,310
Onam va ukam bor.

301
00:17:22,334 --> 00:17:25,809
Uka ham bor ekan?

302
00:17:25,832 --> 00:17:29,199
Yapon tilini oʻrganish qanday?

303
00:17:29,222 --> 00:17:34,502
Gapirishim mumkin, lekin yozish qiyin.

304
00:17:34,525 --> 00:17:38,929
Har kuni qancha vaqt oʻrganasiz?

305
00:17:38,952 --> 00:17:44,038
Har kecha bir soat yapon tilini oʻrganaman.

306
00:17:44,061 --> 00:17:47,744
Davomlilik muhim, shundaymi?

307
00:17:47,767 --> 00:17:53,139
Yapon taomlari ichida eng yoqtirganingiz nima?

308
00:17:53,163 --> 00:17:57,329
Tempura eng yoqtirgan taomim.

309
00:17:57,352 --> 00:18:01,192
Qarsillab, juda mazali!

310
00:18:01,216 --> 00:18:03,883
Yangidan qovurilgani – ajoyib!

311
00:18:03,906 --> 00:18:09,706
Dam olish kunlari yoki bayramlarda odatda nima qilasiz?

312
00:18:09,729 --> 00:18:14,142
Har doim turli nonvoyxonalarga borib turaman.

313
00:18:14,166 --> 00:18:18,199
Yaponiyaning melon nonini oʻrganyapman.

314
00:18:18,222 --> 00:18:22,390
Melon nonmi? Yoqimli ekan!

315
00:18:22,414 --> 00:18:27,147
Yaponiyaning doʻkonlarida odatda nima xarid qilasiz?

316
00:18:27,170 --> 00:18:31,004
Koʻpincha lososli onigiri xarid qilaman.

317
00:18:31,027 --> 00:18:33,997
Qulay va mazali, shuning uchun.

318
00:18:34,020 --> 00:18:36,787
Onigiri juda qulay, shundaymi?

319
00:18:36,810 --> 00:18:40,976
Yaponiyaning qaysi musiqasini yoqtirasiz?

320
00:18:40,999 --> 00:18:44,679
Eski shahar popini yoqtiraman.

321
00:18:44,703 --> 00:18:48,183
Melodiya juda zamonaviy va yoqimli.

322
00:18:48,207 --> 00:18:52,982
Shaharlik pop hozir juda mashhur.

323
00:18:53,005 --> 00:18:56,338
Fransiyada nima mashhur?

324
00:18:56,361 --> 00:18:59,648
Eyfel minorasi juda mashhur.

325
00:18:59,672 --> 00:19:03,672
Vino va pishloq ham juda mazali.

326
00:19:03,695 --> 00:19:06,829
Asl joyidagi vinoni ichishni xohlardim.

327
00:19:06,852 --> 00:19:10,860
Kelajakda Yaponiyada nima qilishni xohlaysiz?

328
00:19:10,883 --> 00:19:16,650
Kelajakda Fransiyada oʻz nonvoyxonamni ochmoqchiman.

329
00:19:16,673 --> 00:19:20,010
Yapon nonlarini tanishtirmoqchiman.

330
00:19:20,033 --> 00:19:22,666
Ajoyib orzu!

331
00:19:22,689 --> 00:19:25,339
Katta rahmat.

