Yaponiyaning sakura gullarini juda yaxshi ko'raman.

403
00:23:12,151 --> 00:23:15,792
Bahorda manzara juda chiroyli edi.

404
00:23:15,815 --> 00:23:18,615
Sakura gullari chiroyli, shunday emasmi?

405
