462
00:26:33,070 --> 00:26:37,236
Yaponiyaning universitetida tahsil olayapman.

463
00:26:37,259 --> 00:26:40,232
Chet elda o‘qish hayotingiz qanday?

464
00:26:40,255 --> 00:26:43,789
Har kuni to‘la va mazmunli o‘tmoqda.

465
00:26:43,812 --> 00:26:46,424
Oilangizda necha kishi bor?

466
00:26:46,447 --> 00:26:49,927
Oilamiz toʻrt kishidan iborat.

467
00:26:49,951 --> 00:26:52,917
Ota-onam va singlim bor.

468
00:26:52,940 --> 00:26:55,874
Singlingiz bormi?

469
00:26:55,897 --> 00:26:58,865
Yapon tilini oʻrganish qanday?

470
00:26:58,888 --> 00:27:02,555
Kanji yozuv tartibi qiyin keladi.

471
00:27:02,578 --> 00:27:06,178
Har kuni qancha vaqt oʻrganasiz?

472
00:27:06,201 --> 00:27:11,934
Har kuni universitet darslaridan tashqari bir soat o‘rganaman.

473
00:27:11,957 --> 00:27:14,524
Ajoyib!

474
00:27:14,547 --> 00:27:19,514
Yapon taomlari ichida eng yoqtirganingiz nima?

475
00:27:19,537 --> 00:27:23,035
Yakitori eng sevimli taomim.

476
00:27:23,058 --> 00:27:26,791
Ayniqsa, tuzli yakitori juda yoqadi.

477
00:27:26,814 --> 00:27:29,855
Tuzli ta’m haqiqatan ham mazali, shunday emasmi?

478
00:27:29,879 --> 00:27:35,355
Dam olish kunlari yoki bayramlarda odatda nima qilasiz?

479
00:27:35,378 --> 00:27:40,178
Har doim do‘stlarim bilan izakaya (yaponcha bar)ga boramiz.

480
00:27:40,201 --> 00:27:44,167
Yapon izakaya madaniyati juda qiziqarli.

481
00:27:44,190 --> 00:27:47,457
Gullik va quvnoq joy, rostdan ham ajoyib!

482
00:27:47,480 --> 00:27:51,247
Yaponiyaning qayerida chang‘i uchdingiz?

483
00:27:51,270 --> 00:27:54,882
Nagano tog‘larida chang‘ida uchdim.

484
00:27:54,905 --> 00:27:59,538
Qor juda yumshoq edi, ajoyib edi!

485
00:27:59,561 --> 00:28:03,340
Nagano chang‘i kurortlari juda mashhur, shunday emasmi?

486
00:28:03,364 --> 00:28:06,836
Sevimli yaponcha so‘zingiz qaysi?

487
00:28:06,860 --> 00:28:11,827
'Ichigo ichie' (bir umrda bir uchrashuv) so‘zi yoqadi.

488
00:28:11,850 --> 00:28:15,461
Uchrashuvlarni qadrlashni xohlayman.

489
00:28:15,484 --> 00:28:18,735
Juda chiroyli so‘z ekan!

490
00:28:18,759 --> 00:28:22,226
Avstraliyada nima mashhur?

491
00:28:22,249 --> 00:28:25,849
Koala va kangurular juda mashhur.

492
00:28:25,872 --> 00:28:29,805
Tabiati juda keng va go‘zal.

493
00:28:29,828 --> 00:28:33,277
Koalani ko‘rishni xohlardim.

494
00:28:33,300 --> 00:28:37,267
Kelajakda Yaponiyada nima qilishni xohlaysiz?

495
00:28:37,290 --> 00:28:42,657
Yaponiya va Avstraliya o‘rtasidagi aloqani mustahkamlashga qaratilgan ish qilishni xohlayman.

496
00:28:42,680 --> 00:28:45,813
Savdo kompaniyasida ishlashni rejalashtiryapman.

497
00:28:45,836 --> 00:28:48,069
Omadingizni bersin!

498
00:28:48,092 --> 00:28:49,759
Katta rahmat.

499
00:28:49,782 --> 00:28:52,195
Katta rahmat.

500
00:28:52,218 --> 00:28:55,218
10-sahna: Tanishuv intervyusi

501
00:28:55,218 --> 00:28:56,752
Salom.

502
00:28:56,775 --> 00:29:00,026
Oxirgi intervyu bo‘ldi.

503
00:29:00,049 --> 00:29:02,816
Ismingiz nima?

504
00:29:02,839 --> 00:29:04,698
Salom.

505
00:29:04,722 --> 00:29:07,597
Men Emma.

506
00:29:07,621 --> 00:29:09,893
Emma ekansiz.

507
00:29:09,916 --> 00:29:12,759
Qayerdan keldingiz?

508
00:29:12,783 --> 00:29:16,599
Angliyadan, Londondan keldim.

509
00:29:16,623 --> 00:29:19,920
Londondanmi?!

510
00:29:19,944 --> 00:29:23,118
Yaponiyada qanchadan beri yashaysiz?

511
00:29:23,141 --> 00:29:26,626
Yaponiyada bir yarim yil bo‘ldim.

512
00:29:26,649 --> 00:29:30,082
Bir yarim yilmi?

513
00:29:30,105 --> 00:29:33,472
Yaponiyadagi hayotingiz qanday?

514
00:29:33,495 --> 00:29:37,761
Yapon an’anaviy madaniyati ajoyib!

515
00:29:37,784 --> 00:29:41,584
Kimono va choy marosimiga qiziqaman.

516
00:29:41,607 --> 00:29:44,224
Yapon madaniyati, shundaymi?

517
00:29:44,248 --> 00:29:46,926
Ishingiz nima?

518
00:29:46,950 --> 00:29:51,800
Men muzey kuratori (san’at asarlari mutaxassisi)man.

519
00:29:51,824 --> 00:29:55,557
Yapon qo‘g‘irchoqlarini o‘rganyapman.

520
00:29:55,580 --> 00:29:59,355
Mutaxassislik darajasidagi ish ekan!

521
00:29:59,379 --> 00:30:02,345
Oilangizda necha kishi bor?

522
00:30:02,368 --> 00:30:05,602
Oilamiz uch kishidan iborat.

523
00:30:05,625 --> 00:30:08,358
Ota-onam bor.

524
00:30:08,381 --> 00:30:10,914
Yolg‘iz farzandmisiz?

525
00:30:10,937 --> 00:30:13,906
Ha, shunday.

526
00:30:13,930 --> 00:30:17,225
Yapon tilini oʻrganish qanday?

527
00:30:17,248 --> 00:30:22,015
Yangiliklar yaponchasi juda qiyin.

528
00:30:22,038 --> 00:30:27,571
Har kuni qancha vaqt oʻrganasiz?

529
00:30:27,594 --> 00:30:34,561
Har kuni bir soat gazeta o‘qiyman. Gazeta o‘qish – bu yuqori daraja, shunday emasmi?

530
00:30:34,584 --> 00:30:39,756
Yapon taomlari ichida eng yoqtirganingiz nima?

531
00:30:39,780 --> 00:30:44,180
Unagi kabayaki (ilonbaliq kabobi) eng sevimli taomim.

532
00:30:44,203 --> 00:30:47,773
Sousi juda mazali.

533
00:30:47,796 --> 00:30:50,834
Unagi qimmat taom, shunday emasmi?

534
00:30:50,858 --> 00:30:53,491
Ha, juda mazali!

535
00:30:53,514 --> 00:30:58,522
Dam olish kunlari yoki bayramlarda odatda nima qilasiz?

536
00:30:58,546 --> 00:31:02,634
Men doim eski shahar ko'chalarida sayr qilaman.

537
00:31:02,657 --> 00:31:06,590
Yapon arxitekturasini tomosha qilaman.

538
00:31:06,613 --> 00:31:09,580
Siz tarixni yaxshi ko'rasiz, shundaymi?

539
00:31:09,603 --> 00:31:12,870
Kecha qayerga bordingiz?

540
00:31:12,893 --> 00:31:17,426
Kyoto shahridagi Kinkaku-ji ibodatxonasiga bordim.

541
00:31:17,449 --> 00:31:21,318
Oltin rangda juda go'zal edi!

542
00:31:21,342 --> 00:31:24,675
Kinkaku-ji haqiqatan ham hayratlanarli joy, shunday emasmi?

543
00:31:24,698 --> 00:31:29,431
Yaponiyaning an'anaviy tadbirlarida ishtirok etganmisiz?

544
00:31:29,454 --> 00:31:34,389
O'tgan hafta yozgi festivalda Bon raqsi raqsini tushdim.

545
00:31:34,413 --> 00:31:38,946
Mahalla ahli bilan birga raqsga tushib, juda qiziq boldi.

546
00:31:38,969 --> 00:31:42,253
Bu yaxshi xotira bo'lib qoladi, shundaymi?

547
00:31:42,276 --> 00:31:45,610
Angliyada nima mashhur?

548
00:31:45,633 --> 00:31:50,300
Big Ben deb nomlangan soat minorasi juda mashhur.

549
00:31:50,323 --> 00:31:53,770
Choy ham har kuni ko'p ichamiz.

550
00:31:53,794 --> 00:31:57,892
Asl ingliz choyini tatib ko'rmoqchiman.

551
00:31:57,915 --> 00:32:01,717
Kelajakda Yaponiyada nima qilishni xohlaysiz?

552
00:32:01,740 --> 00:32:07,107
Yapon madaniyatini Angliyaga tanishtiruvchi kitob chiqarmoqchiman.

553
00:32:07,130 --> 00:32:11,201
Ko'proq tadqiqot qilishni davom ettirmoqchiman.

554
00:32:11,225 --> 00:32:14,682
Kitob chiqishini shoshilinch kutaman.

555
00:32:14,705 --> 00:32:16,923
Katta rahmat.

556
00:32:16,946 --> 00:32:19,985
Katta rahmat.